&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dff042416a74a3cf0a7f456c845950e2 3x"}, "body": "リリアンちゃんが年下少年のおちんちんにおしっこをかける作品をお願いします。\n　お風呂でリリアンの裸を見て無意識に勃起してしまった少年。リリアンが「直してあげる」と言って少年を風呂場に寝かせる。溜めてたおしっこを勢いよく放ちおちんちんに直撃させる。未知の感覚に興奮しすぎて絶頂する男の子。おしっこが終わると少年のおちんちんは小さくなっていた。混乱しながらおしっこまみれで感謝する少年。", "nc": 176, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@joka_pow6/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1351458, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6aa760b1/uploads/origins/4956b629-02fb-415e-9c74-ed4dc2890825?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f79d84434356e92f93d57ff18156cbcf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6aa760b1/uploads/origins/4956b629-02fb-415e-9c74-ed4dc2890825?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f79d84434356e92f93d57ff18156cbcf, https://si.imgix.net/6aa760b1/uploads/origins/4956b629-02fb-415e-9c74-ed4dc2890825?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74f3454936f03f76239a3ecc4c608870 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6aa760b1/uploads/origins/4956b629-02fb-415e-9c74-ed4dc2890825?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=46bda31737dc12bd2deb1f4e003097ed 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6aa760b1/uploads/origins/4956b629-02fb-415e-9c74-ed4dc2890825?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8721a49418c936271b7adb96a502f13b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6aa760b1/uploads/origins/4956b629-02fb-415e-9c74-ed4dc2890825?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8721a49418c936271b7adb96a502f13b, https://si.imgix.net/6aa760b1/uploads/origins/4956b629-02fb-415e-9c74-ed4dc2890825?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cc9cf830c7722f8e93a4fd9392630231 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6aa760b1/uploads/origins/4956b629-02fb-415e-9c74-ed4dc2890825?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9c00f3bb421febc587b371efa948597a 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは！リクエストの内容ですが、ようかあああああさんの子のリリアンちゃんでお願いします。\n\n内容は和式トイレで限界放尿するけど勢いが良すぎておしっこが金隠しを上にはみ出してしまうけどまぁいっかっと思ってそのままおしっこをし続けるリリアンちゃんお願いします！\n\n服装などは指定はありませんので自由にお願いします", "nc": 32, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@joka_pow6/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1351458, "client_id": 118639, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4bc3ff26/uploads/origins/69fa7ab7-1d17-4a19-a0c6-2d063afbc990?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e22856fb1ef6a95e6afdd2f4beac9bd", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4bc3ff26/uploads/origins/69fa7ab7-1d17-4a19-a0c6-2d063afbc990?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e22856fb1ef6a95e6afdd2f4beac9bd, https://si.imgix.net/4bc3ff26/uploads/origins/69fa7ab7-1d17-4a19-a0c6-2d063afbc990?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=77e698e1c85fa21492290a6b999f804c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4bc3ff26/uploads/origins/69fa7ab7-1d17-4a19-a0c6-2d063afbc990?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff88f5c3b008ea22207bda82eb68eb3f 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4bc3ff26/uploads/origins/69fa7ab7-1d17-4a19-a0c6-2d063afbc990?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=59fc4f0ecf69286cad05fd1a21302417", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4bc3ff26/uploads/origins/69fa7ab7-1d17-4a19-a0c6-2d063afbc990?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=59fc4f0ecf69286cad05fd1a21302417, https://si.imgix.net/4bc3ff26/uploads/origins/69fa7ab7-1d17-4a19-a0c6-2d063afbc990?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8d932eeb0addf5da36ec4dad51b60712 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4bc3ff26/uploads/origins/69fa7ab7-1d17-4a19-a0c6-2d063afbc990?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b1c42ec087cc3140497f8ca6559d3cd7 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは～。\n\n短いマンガでも、普通の写真でも構いません。あなたがより良いと思うものを選んでください。\n\nある砂漠の村には、湖がありますが、完全に干上がってしまいました。そこで、彼らは女神に水の補給を祈ります。女神は満杯の膀胱（膨らんだ膀胱）を持ってやってきて、湖に水を補充します。\n\n湖を埋め尽くすか、湖を溢れさせるかのどちらかにすればいいと思います。\n女神は巨大で、村よりも大きな存在であるべきだと思います。\n\n\nありがとうございます～。\n\nHello~!\n\nEither a short comic, or regular picture is fine. Choose what you think would work better.\n\nA village in a desert has a lake by them which has dried completely. So they pray to their goddess for more water. The goddess comes in with a full bladder (Bulging bladder) to refill the lake.\n\nI think either filling or flood the lake would be great.\n\nI think the goddess should be giant and bigger than the village.\n\nThank you~", "nc": 32, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@joka_pow6/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1351458, "client_id": 118639, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f8020882/uploads/origins/65bb484c-c7e0-430d-b859-e3a9bc406115?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7ff6088fe0128447e95a65ce17ca08e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f8020882/uploads/origins/65bb484c-c7e0-430d-b859-e3a9bc406115?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7ff6088fe0128447e95a65ce17ca08e, https://si.imgix.net/f8020882/uploads/origins/65bb484c-c7e0-430d-b859-e3a9bc406115?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a3b51f2fb538d17acfe78ba0c48543f3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f8020882/uploads/origins/65bb484c-c7e0-430d-b859-e3a9bc406115?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4488e8da858962de4809bb746b8a6c69 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f8020882/uploads/origins/65bb484c-c7e0-430d-b859-e3a9bc406115?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9ba5383b2383a9d68026f4891942f1f2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f8020882/uploads/origins/65bb484c-c7e0-430d-b859-e3a9bc406115?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9ba5383b2383a9d68026f4891942f1f2, https://si.imgix.net/f8020882/uploads/origins/65bb484c-c7e0-430d-b859-e3a9bc406115?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=66542269ca3131eb63de066ec09adfd1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f8020882/uploads/origins/65bb484c-c7e0-430d-b859-e3a9bc406115?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2f83071e4dbabc99a91f85eb49150f17 3x"}, "body": "Hello!\nI would like to request a Black and White (Sketch) done. \nI may ask for this in full color another time.\n\nYou can use any characters you feel like.\n\nI would like to have 2 people (1 girl at least) to be taking a bath together as if they were still kids.\n\nI would the girl to be troublesome with the other person and blast pee on the other persons face. (Stronger pee the better)\n\nThank you. \n\nこんにちは。\n白黒（スケッチ）をお願いしたいのですが。\nこれはまた別の機会にフルカラーでお願いするかもしれません。\n \n自分の好きなキャラクターを使うことができます。\n \n2人（最低でも女の子1人）で、まだ子供のように一緒にお風呂に入ってもらいたいですね。\n \n女の子が相手を困らせて、相手の顔にオシッコを吹きかけてほしい。(おしっこの勢いは強いほうがいいです。)\n \nありがとうございました。", "nc": 169, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@joka_pow6/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1351458, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4edace7a/uploads/origins/866c8191-e2df-47fc-9b60-aff73fa953e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5834ec89ac91cfcfa2cd20450e79f64", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4edace7a/uploads/origins/866c8191-e2df-47fc-9b60-aff73fa953e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5834ec89ac91cfcfa2cd20450e79f64, https://si.imgix.net/4edace7a/uploads/origins/866c8191-e2df-47fc-9b60-aff73fa953e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=33f55d84948ee80f8908fcc8538deb6c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4edace7a/uploads/origins/866c8191-e2df-47fc-9b60-aff73fa953e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fc319627e6eb991a62aca7a72d617bf 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4edace7a/uploads/origins/866c8191-e2df-47fc-9b60-aff73fa953e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0ad0abd65b9cbfdc9efa9789c470692c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4edace7a/uploads/origins/866c8191-e2df-47fc-9b60-aff73fa953e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0ad0abd65b9cbfdc9efa9789c470692c, https://si.imgix.net/4edace7a/uploads/origins/866c8191-e2df-47fc-9b60-aff73fa953e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9fc281211dc7f51212e6f881cec1f9fb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4edace7a/uploads/origins/866c8191-e2df-47fc-9b60-aff73fa953e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b1140dbc3bae7be62f6caab6d70d4a9a 3x"}, "body": "花火大会か何かで茂みから野ションを盗撮する動画に運悪く偶然ターゲットとして映り込んでしまった黛冬優子をお願いします。限界で少し先走っているような様子で、後述の内容のため茂みのせいで口元くらいまでしか見えない感じで、確定させられはしないもののおそらく当人だと思える、というようなものだと助かります。\n\nイラストとは別の部分になると思うので可能ならばで構わないので